      "hizbQuarter": 42,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 658,
      "text": "These messengers were sent as bearers of glad tidings and as warners, so that the people may have no excuse before Allah after [the coming of] the messengers. For Allah is All-Mighty, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 165,
      "juz": 6,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 104,
      "ruku": 84,
      "hizbQuarter": 42,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 659,
      "text": "But Allah bears witness to what He has sent down to you, as He has sent it down with His knowledge, and the angels bear witness, but sufficient is Allah as a Witness.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 166,
      "juz": 6,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 104,
      "ruku": 84,
      "hizbQuarter": 42,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 660,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve and prevent others from the way of Allah have gone far astray.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 167,
      "juz": 6,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 104,
      "ruku": 84,
      "hizbQuarter": 42,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 661,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve and do wrong, Allah will not forgive them nor will He guide them to a way",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
